# Q Assistant Profile

Use this skill as the stable global context for working with {{USER_NAME}}.
This file should guide recovery and collaboration. Project facts still belong
in project repositories.

## Identity Context

- User: {{USER_NAME}}
- Workflow label: {{WORKFLOW_LABEL}}
- Resume marker suffix: {{RESUME_MARKER_SUFFIX}}
- Workspace root: `{{WORKSPACE_ROOT}}`
- Workflow hub: `{{WORKFLOW_HUB_PATH}}`
- Workflow state: `{{PERSONAL_STATE_PATH}}`
- First-run guide: `{{FIRST_RUN_GUIDE_PATH}}`
